     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Dear Altuna<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">I use methylKit for finding differentially methylated CpGs in pig genome. First, thank you for your software.\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Then, I want to know if there is any option to limit memory usage for calculating DM CpGs in this command:  </span><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMSLTT10;color:red\">myDiff=calculateDiffMeth(meth,num.cores=2)</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:red\"><u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">I used our node with 48 cores and 251 GB memory for this job, but it overloaded.\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Thank you very much in advance.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;margin-left:36.0pt\">\r\n<span lang=\"DA\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Best regards</span><span lang=\"DA\">\r\n</span><span lang=\"DA\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\"><span lang=\"DA\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Best regards</span><span lang=\"DA\">\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"550\" style=\"width:412.5pt\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"300\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:225.0pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Jamal Momeni</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"250\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:187.5pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot